      "text": "def post_order(node, visited):\n    # Kein Knoten: Dieser Aufruf ist fertig.\n    if node is None:\n        return\n\n    # 1. links, 2. rechts, 3. Knoten.\n    post_order(node.left, visited)\n    post_order(node.right, visited)\n    visited.append(node.value)\n\n# Eigene Ergebnisliste für diesen Durchlauf.\npost_order_values = []\npost_order(bt.root, post_order_values)\nprint(post_order_values)",
      "originalText": "def post_order(node, visited):\n    # Kein Knoten: Dieser Aufruf ist fertig.\n    if node is None:\n        return\n\n    # 1. links, 2. rechts, 3. Knoten.\n    post_order(node.left, visited)\n    post_order(node.right, visited)\n    visited.append(node.value)\n\n# Eigene Ergebnisliste für diesen Durchlauf.\npost_order_values = []\npost_order(bt.root, post_order_values)\nprint(post_order_values)",
